  "_comment": "Tier map: the one source for agent models and effort, and for skill effort (me2resh/apexyard#2033, AgDR-0294). 'tiers' maps each tier to a model and an effort for each harness. 'agents' maps each .claude/agents/<name>.md file to a tier, with an optional per-agent effort ('inherit' omits the effort line). 'stages' maps a work stage to an effort, and 'skills' maps each skill that declares effort to a stage. To change a model, edit one tier line, then run bin/sync-agent-tiers.sh. 'bin/sync-agent-tiers.sh --check' fails on drift. Every harness adapter reads this file: the Codex adapter reads the 'codex' column. Add a column for a new harness here, not a second map. Per AgDR-0087, keep the 'reason' tier on each harness's strongest model. Keep 'rank' order reason > build > light: reviewers stay above builders.",
